# ── SG16 AI Engine — build-time configuration ────────────────────────────
# The AI connection is NOT configured here. AI keys, endpoint and models are
# owner secrets on the backend (Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Variables and
# Secrets): AI_BASE_URL, AI_API_KEY, AI_CHAT_MODEL, AI_CODING_MODEL,
# AI_VISION_MODEL, AI_AUDIO_MODEL, AI_IMAGE_MODEL, AI_FALLBACK_MODELS.
# See ARCHITECTURE.md. Never put a key in a VITE_ variable — those are
# compiled into the public JavaScript bundle.
#
# Copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and fill in what you need.

# --- Live web search ------------------------------------------------------
# 1 (default): time-sensitive questions get live news/web context via the
# edge functions (/api/edge/news, /api/edge/search). Set to 0 to disable.
# VITE_SG16_LIVE_SEARCH=1

# --- Local development ----------------------------------------------------
# `npm run dev` serves only the SPA (no /api). For the full stack:
#   npm run build && npx wrangler pages dev dist
# with local AI secrets in project/.dev.vars (git-ignored), e.g.
#   AI_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com/v1
#   AI_CHAT_MODEL=your-model
